{
  "info": {
    "name": "MarketBasketAnalysis REST API",
    "description": "Postman collection for the MarketBasketAnalysis REST API, the same API that the [`@marketbasketanalysis/mcp`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@marketbasketanalysis/mcp) server wraps. Use this collection to exercise the underlying endpoints without going through MCP.\n\n## Setup\n\n1. Fork or duplicate this collection in your Postman workspace.\n2. Set the collection variable `apiKey` to your `mba_live_...` key (Shopify app -> API keys, or your Magento / WooCommerce admin -> API keys).\n3. Optionally override `baseUrl` if you're pointing at a self-hosted instance.\n4. The `Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}` header is set on the collection root; every request inherits it.\n\n## Endpoints covered\n\n- Native API (`/api/v1/*`): recommendations, substitutions, B2B reorder predictions, product feeds (Google Merchant Center, Meta Catalog, TikTok Shop).\n- ACP-shaped wrappers (`/api/acp/v1/*`): the same data plane, shaped to the [Agentic Commerce Protocol](https://github.com/agentic-commerce-protocol/agentic-commerce-protocol) spec 2026-04-17.\n- Discovery (`/.well-known/agentic-commerce`): unauthenticated capability document for agent crawlers.\n\nDocs: https://marketbasketanalysis.com/docs\nMCP cookbook: https://github.com/48x-ai/marketbasketanalysis/tree/main/packages/mcp/docs/cookbook",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_postman_id": "mba-rest-collection-v1",
    "version": "0.3.1"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{apiKey}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('apiKey')) {",
          "  console.warn('apiKey is empty. Set the collection variable apiKey to your mba_live_... key before sending requests.');",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://app.marketbasketanalysis.com",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Hosted production API base. Override for self-hosted / staging deployments."
    },
    {
      "key": "apiKey",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Your mba_live_... key. Mint one in the merchant admin under API keys."
    },
    {
      "key": "feedToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Feed-scoped token (gmc_..., meta_..., tiktok_...). Different from apiKey because product feeds are tier-gated and scoped to a single shop. Mint feed tokens separately in the admin."
    },
    {
      "key": "productId",
      "value": "gid://shopify/Product/8472918765",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Sample Shopify product GID. Numeric storefront ids ('8472918765') are also accepted by the REST API."
    },
    {
      "key": "customerId",
      "value": "7654321",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Sample Shopify customer id. Numeric storefront id or full GID (gid://shopify/Customer/7654321) both accepted."
    },
    {
      "key": "shopDomain",
      "value": "your-shop.myshopify.com",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Your Shopify shop domain, used as the ?shop= query param on feed endpoints."
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Native API (/api/v1)",
      "description": "The native REST surface. Bearer-token auth using your mba_live_... API key. These are the endpoints the MCP server consumes.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /api/v1/recommendations",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recommendations?product_id={{productId}}&limit=3",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "recommendations"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "product_id",
                  "value": "{{productId}}",
                  "description": "Numeric storefront id ('8472918765') or platform-specific GID / SKU. Required."
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "3",
                  "description": "Max recommendations to return. Default 3, max 6."
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "For a single product, returns the top complementary products customers also bought, derived from association rules mined from the merchant's actual order history.\n\nSet `apiKey` before sending. The `Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}` header is inherited from the collection root.\n\nCookbook: [`get-recommendations.md`](./docs/cookbook/get-recommendations.md). MCP tool that wraps this: `get_recommendations`."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK (typical)",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recommendations?product_id={{productId}}&limit=3",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "recommendations"],
                  "query": [
                    { "key": "product_id", "value": "{{productId}}" },
                    { "key": "limit", "value": "3" }
                  ]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"recommendations\": [\n    {\n      \"productId\": \"gid://shopify/Product/9182734651\",\n      \"sku\": \"CLN-001\",\n      \"title\": \"Camera Cleaning Kit\",\n      \"vendor\": \"OpticsPro\",\n      \"productType\": \"Accessory\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.64,\n      \"returnRate\": 0.04,\n      \"returnedCount\": 12,\n      \"price\": 24.99,\n      \"currency\": \"USD\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"productId\": \"gid://shopify/Product/9182734652\",\n      \"sku\": \"SD-032\",\n      \"title\": \"32GB SD Card\",\n      \"vendor\": \"StoragePro\",\n      \"productType\": \"Storage\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.51,\n      \"returnRate\": 0.02,\n      \"returnedCount\": 4,\n      \"price\": 19.99,\n      \"currency\": \"USD\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"model_version\": \"fp-growth-2026-05\",\n  \"shop_id\": \"shop_abc123\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "200 OK (no recommendations)",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recommendations?product_id=8472918999&limit=3",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "recommendations"]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"recommendations\": [],\n  \"model_version\": \"fp-growth-2026-05\",\n  \"shop_id\": \"shop_abc123\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "401 Unauthorized",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recommendations?product_id={{productId}}",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "recommendations"]
                }
              },
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"error\": \"invalid_token\",\n  \"message\": \"API key missing or revoked.\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/v1/substitutions",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/substitutions?product_id={{productId}}&limit=3",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "substitutions"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "product_id",
                  "value": "{{productId}}",
                  "description": "The product the caller wants to REPLACE. Required."
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "3",
                  "description": "Max substitutes. Default 3, max 6."
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "For a single product, returns ranked replacement options (the inverse of recommendations). Each result carries a `score` (0..1) and a `reason` (context_similar, category_match, vendor_match).\n\nSet `apiKey` before sending. Cookbook: [`find-substitutes.md`](./docs/cookbook/find-substitutes.md). MCP tool: `find_substitutes`."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK (typical)",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/substitutions?product_id={{productId}}&limit=3",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "substitutions"]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"substitutions\": [\n    {\n      \"productId\": \"gid://shopify/Product/9182734851\",\n      \"sku\": \"BAG-225\",\n      \"title\": \"Hiking Daypack 25L\",\n      \"vendor\": \"PackCo\",\n      \"productType\": \"Backpack\",\n      \"score\": 0.78,\n      \"reason\": \"context_similar\",\n      \"signals\": {\n        \"contextOverlap\": 0.78,\n        \"coOccurrence\": 0.42,\n        \"sameProductType\": true,\n        \"sameVendor\": false\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"productId\": \"gid://shopify/Product/9182734852\",\n      \"sku\": \"BAG-430\",\n      \"title\": \"Travel Backpack 30L\",\n      \"vendor\": \"PackCo\",\n      \"productType\": \"Backpack\",\n      \"score\": 0.64,\n      \"reason\": \"category_match\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "200 OK (no substitutes)",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/substitutions?product_id=8472919900",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "substitutions"]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"substitutions\": []\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/v1/accounts/:customerId/reorder-predictions",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/{{customerId}}/reorder-predictions?limit=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "accounts", "{{customerId}}", "reorder-predictions"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "20",
                  "description": "Max predictions to return. Optional."
                },
                {
                  "key": "product_id",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "Optional: filter to a single product id.",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "B2B reorder predictions for a single customer. Returns one prediction per SKU the customer has ordered >= 2 times, bucketed into `overdue`, `due_soon`, `on_track`, `not_predictable`.\n\n**Shopify only in v0.3.** Magento and WooCommerce ports are roadmap.\n\nSet `apiKey` before sending. Set `customerId` to a real customer's storefront id. Cookbook: [`predict-reorder.md`](./docs/cookbook/predict-reorder.md). MCP tool: `predict_reorder`."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK (typical)",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/{{customerId}}/reorder-predictions",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "accounts", "{{customerId}}", "reorder-predictions"]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"customerId\": \"7654321\",\n  \"totalOrders\": 41,\n  \"windowOrders\": 38,\n  \"predictions\": [\n    {\n      \"productId\": \"gid://shopify/Product/9182739001\",\n      \"sku\": \"SOLV-1L\",\n      \"title\": \"Cleaning Solvent 1L\",\n      \"totalOrders\": 11,\n      \"lastOrderedAt\": \"2026-05-04T14:22:00Z\",\n      \"meanIntervalDays\": 28,\n      \"stdevDays\": 4.2,\n      \"predictedNextAt\": \"2026-05-28T14:22:00Z\",\n      \"daysUntilPredicted\": -4,\n      \"confidence\": 0.82,\n      \"status\": \"overdue\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"productId\": \"gid://shopify/Product/9182739010\",\n      \"sku\": \"WIPES-100\",\n      \"title\": \"Lens Wipes Box\",\n      \"totalOrders\": 14,\n      \"lastOrderedAt\": \"2026-05-21T09:11:00Z\",\n      \"meanIntervalDays\": 21,\n      \"stdevDays\": 2.6,\n      \"predictedNextAt\": \"2026-06-11T09:11:00Z\",\n      \"daysUntilPredicted\": 3,\n      \"confidence\": 0.88,\n      \"status\": \"due_soon\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "200 OK (insufficient history)",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
