    {
      "name": "ACP wrappers (/api/acp/v1)",
      "description": "[Agentic Commerce Protocol](https://github.com/agentic-commerce-protocol/agentic-commerce-protocol) (spec 2026-04-17) shaped wrappers around the native endpoints. Same data, shape conforms to ACP `ProductsResponse`. Use these when integrating with an agent framework that already speaks ACP.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /api/acp/v1/recommendations",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
